 "_doc": "STANDARDS-FIRST-1 (Rowan, 2026-11-25): JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) for every config and manifest. `python3 -m foundation standards --schemas` (in `standards --check`) validates every file under `scope` against the schema `map` names for it, or finds it on `baseline`. The baseline only shrinks: its length may not pass `baseline_ceiling`, a file that gains a schema leaves it, and a new config arrives with its schema. Read by foundation/schemas.py; tests tests/foundation/test_schemas.py.",
